# The format check's declaration of what it does not examine.
#
# Until 2026-09-02 this file also listed *.md, *.markdown, *.yml and *.yaml, on
# the ground that markdownlint owned Markdown and yamllint owned YAML. FR-022
# reversed that: Prettier now formats both, and those two tools gave up the
# rules Prettier rewrites, so each of those content kinds has exactly one
# formatting configuration (this one) and exactly one linting configuration.
# Re-adding those four patterns would silently remove the formatting coverage
# FR-021 requires -- Prettier would report nothing rather than complain.
#
# This file IS the declaration, not a mirror of one. The runner reads it --
# extract_prettier in scripts/lib/scope.sh -- and turns each line into a git
# pathspec exclusion; Prettier reads it too, so a by-hand `prettier --check .`
# applies exactly the same exclusions. There is no second copy to keep in step
# and no check policing the agreement, because there is nothing to disagree.
# See specs/004-format-hook-scope/contracts/exclusion-declaration.md.

.git
.specify/scripts
.specify/templates
.specify/integrations
.specify/workflows
.specify/extensions
.specify/.gitignore
.specify/init-options.json
.specify/integration.json
.specify/memory/.constitution-template.json
.claude/settings.json
.claude/skills
LEAN-CTX.md
.remember
node_modules
.venv
venv
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
.lint-selftest-tmp
